    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76076" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφείλ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is owed, debt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.40
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτίνειν ὀ</span>. <i><span class="en">
